	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 14th level, you gain the ability to rapidly alter the battlefield. You can spend your action to teleport yourself and up to five willing creatures to any location within 120ft. Each creature must be placed within 30ft of each other in an unoccupied space that can support their weight. You then gain a level of Strife.</p><p>In addition, you are now able to access 4th tier maneuvers, and may replace two maneuvers you know.</p>",
